---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Water Quality"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Tap water is delivering endocrine disruptors, neurotoxins, and microplastics with every glass — filtration is not optional."
  slug="environment-water"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/water"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Municipal water meets legal standards written before PFAS, microplastics, and pharmaceutical residues were detected — fluoride suppresses thyroid, chloramine byproducts are documented carcinogens, PFAS disrupts hormone signaling and accumulates in tissue</li>
    <li>Shower and bath exposure is a second route: chlorinated hot water creates inhalation exposure to volatile byproducts that can exceed oral ingestion in total daily load</li>
    <li>Water filtration is one of the most straightforward, one-time interventions in the environmental protocol — cost-per-day is lower than almost any supplement, and it eliminates a daily load no supplement can compensate for</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products — E-Commerce Hero ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p>Protocol-matched products for your water filtration protocol. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>
  <div class="product-grid">
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Under-Sink Reverse Osmosis System</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Removes 99%+ of PFAS, fluoride, heavy metals, and microplastics at the point of use.</p>
      <p>Multi-stage RO system with remineralization filter. The most comprehensive drinking-water intervention available.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=ro-system -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Under-Sink RO System" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Shower Head Filter</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Protects skin microbiome and eliminates chlorine inhalation during hot showers.</p>
      <p>KDF + vitamin C filter compatible with standard shower heads. Removes chlorine and chloramine effectively in hot water.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=shower-filter -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Shower Head Filter" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Whole-Home Carbon Filtration</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Comprehensive protection at every tap and shower — the upgrade path for high-exposure households.</p>
      <p>Whole-house carbon block filter. For well-water and high-contamination municipal supplies.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=whole-home-filter -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Whole-Home Carbon Filter" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Filter Cartridge Replacement Subscription</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Expired filters deliver contaminants plus whatever has grown in the filter media — subscriptions fix this.</p>
      <p>Quarterly or semi-annual delivery for common RO and shower filter systems — replacement happens on schedule.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=filter-subscription -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Filter Replacement Subscription" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Deeper Protocol ── -->
  <h2>The Deeper Protocol</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Drinking unfiltered tap water — fluoride, PFAS, chlorine, chloramines, and microplastics with every glass</li>
    <li>Plastic water bottles — microplastics and endocrine-disrupting compounds leach in, especially with heat</li>
    <li>Showering in unfiltered hot water — chlorine volatilizes and is inhaled and absorbed through skin</li>
    <li>Never replacing filter cartridges — an expired filter delivers contaminants plus whatever has grown inside it</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Fix sequence: under-sink RO first (drinking and cooking water — your primary oral route) → shower filter (inhalation and skin route) →
    switch to glass or stainless containers (eliminates plastic leaching, costs nothing) → whole-home filtration if on a well or high-exposure municipal supply.
  </p>

  <a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="blog-deepdive-btn">
    Read More: Full Environmental Protocol →
  </a>

  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light);">
    <em>Affiliate disclosure: My4MLife may earn a commission on purchases made through product links on this page. All products are independently evaluated against the My4MLife protocol standards before inclusion.</em>
  </p>

  <!-- ── Optional Protégé footer ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    Want personalized guidance on your environmental protocol? <strong>Become a Protégé free</strong> — the My4MLife App walks you through environmental optimization week by week.
    <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="protege-link">Join My4MLife →</a>
  </div>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.product-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
}
.product-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,184,148,0.14);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.product-card h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.product-why {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.product-card p {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin: 0;
  flex: 1;
}
.notify-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.35);
  padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
}
.btn-cart {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  align-self: flex-start;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}
.btn-cart:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

.blog-deepdive-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem;
  padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
}
.blog-deepdive-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}

.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 1rem 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.protege-link {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.protege-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
